WEBVTT

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.740
<b>From Thorny</b>

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:01.750
Sasaki Tetsunosuke?

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.850
Yeah, he's a member of 
the famous Sasaki family

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:07.600
that produces all those 
elite members of society.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.100
But for some reason,

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.340
he's the only failure who screws around

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.840
and doesn't have a job.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:15.770
He was becoming a problem, 
so we took him in.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.500
So basically,

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.810
he's a spoiled brat who was 
forsaken by his parents

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:22.470
because they didn't want to look bad.

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:25.440
Kondo-san, this isn't a juvie.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:30.040
You should turn him over to those 
other cops, the Mimawarigumi.

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:30.040
Yeah, it's me.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.440
They're a bunch of elite 
cops from famous families.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.440
I'm in a dojo or something right now.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:35.410
This is lame.

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:36.950
Isn't their leader a Sasaki?

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:36.950
Can I go home?

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.300
They probably kept shuffling him

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.810
around until he ended up here.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:44.880
Fine, let him in my first squad.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:48.020
I'll send him straight into a 
battle and straight to his grave.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.120
No, the higher-ups won't be happy 
if something happens to him.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.220
Then we can give him 
some menial tasks to do.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:55.700
No, he'll start whining.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:57.220
Right, Toshi!

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:58.850
You mentioned that you 
had a bunch of busy work

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:00.890
that you wanted to 
delegate to an assistant.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:08.240
<b>Check It Out!!</b>

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:11.140
Yo, I'm Tetsu.

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:14.240
Uh, your name is Toshikata?

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:17.390
No idea what an assistant does,

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:20.440
but I guess I just have to lay 
the smackdown on that Joi gang?

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:25.790
Nobody beats me in a fight, fo' shizzle.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:30.340
It's not my policy to listen 
to anyone weaker than me.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:31.760
I don't follow anyone else's rules.

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:35.600
We're all born equal and free.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.370
Then you got your friends 
and your enemies.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:41.730
So if you try to boss me around, 
I'll go beast on your ass.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.890
Watch yourself, 'kay?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.590
I might lose control.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:47.570
Be fair, be square.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.340
We cool, Toshi?

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:50.150
Yeah!

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.280
Hey, you little prick.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:57.890
Don't chew when you're 
introducing yourself.

00:03:57.890 --> 00:04:02.210
I got enough of your type in 
the 17th volume of Oishinbo!

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:05.880
And why is one pant leg rolled up?

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.690
I think one leg is 
shorter than the other?

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:12.080
There, now they're the 
same length! Oh, boy.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.100
Listen up.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:16.960
You're on our turf, so 
you follow our rules.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:20.770
For dumb boys like you,
one slip and it's seppuku time!

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.780
Doesn't matter who your dad is!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.980
I'll send your head flying 
all the way to your dad!

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:30.090
Yeah! We cool, Tetsu.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:33.730
We BFFs now, yeah!

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:34.570
Yeah.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:37.600
Well, let me know when 
there's a fight going down.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:39.840
I'll bring all my buddies.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.140
Appreciate it.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:51.850
If we kick him out, he 
won't have anywhere to go.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.890
Just go easy on him.

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.180
It'll take time to work him in.

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:59.180
It'll take time? How much time?

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:04.690
How am I supposed to stop myself 
from killing him before then?

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:11.520
Vice chief, I heard 
you got an assistant?

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.900
Y-Yeah...

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.210
That's great.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.610
You've mentioned how 
busy you always are.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:18.470
So where is he?

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:20.120
I have him running errands.

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:23.280
Sweet curry?

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:24.800
Spicy curry?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.910
Yeah!

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:30.420
Uh, that corner of the 
room is oozing New York.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:30.080
I'll do sweet curry. You do spicy curry.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.070
Good stuff.

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:31.970
Excuse me.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.910
Could you give me my curry?

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:36.550
Uh, what? What are you doing?

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.460
Hey, hey, hey!!

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:39.470
What?!

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:40.270
I don't have any money on me!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.720
All I have is a plate of rice!

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.840
Hey!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.980
Why are they acting like this 
is some kind of drug deal?!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.640
Cherry boy!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.870
Don't call me a cherry boy!

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:55.360
How can you even tell?!

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:57.530
<b>Mayonnaise five days a week! -Hijikata</b>

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:00.300
Hey! What did you slip in my pocket?!

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:01.080
No, thanks!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.950
I don't need your goods!

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.290
Hey! Stop it!

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.950
Wait! It's curry?!

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.460
Effin'!

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.380
No, no, no, no!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.020
You're not supposed to 
swing with your wrist!

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.880
Use your entire body to swing!

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:16.620
The sword requires concentration!

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:17.850
Hold your breath!

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:19.760
Then swing for everything you're worth!

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.370
This isn't some wimpy sport!

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:22.710
Fancy tricks won't get you anywhere!

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:30.420
Hey, hey! Pass!

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.260
Gorilla, come on!

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:36.510
I'll repeat myself!

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:37.360
Fancy tricks...

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.660
Hey, hey! Gorilla!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.650
Gorilla, pass!

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:43.650
Listen up!

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.620
I'll repeat myself one last time!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.300
Your left hand is only 
there for support!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.690
Nice shot!

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:54.280
Hey, Tetsu.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.380
Can you turn it down a bit?

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:59.090
What? I can't hear you.

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:01.510
Can you turn it down?!

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:03.290
Okay, okay!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.470
So you're also a fan 
of these crazy lyrics.

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:09.480
No, Toshi hates hip-hop.

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:12.040
Shit! What are you doing, Toshi?

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.190
Hey, Tetsu.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:16.530
You can't keep doing this forever.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:25.520
This is your last chance.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:28.320
I'm sure you've realized 
that you'll never get

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:30.590
anywhere in society like this.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.170
Shit, I don't need another lecture.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:36.840
You can't boss me around.

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.670
This is how I choose to live.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.380
If you run into a wall and pretend

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:46.100
it doesn't exist, you'll 
never make any progress.

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:48.320
The wall will never change.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.100
So you're the one who has to change.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:57.110
Right now, you're just rattling 
off excuses at the wall.

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.410
You're nothing more than a kid.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:02.110
Before, you might have 
gotten away with that.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:07.600
But in our line of work, 
one wrong move and you die.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.790
If you're going to drag 
down the Shinsengumi,

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.870
I'll have to cut you down.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.750
When a warrior fails his 
duty, he commits seppuku.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.710
We used to be as dumb as you,

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:22.840
but we were able to make it this far.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.370
Then cut me down.

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:28.950
I can never be like my brother.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.510
I don't belong with the Sasaki family,

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.100
and I don't belong here.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:35.060
I was born a failure.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:38.900
So I'll live as I please 
and die as I please!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.930
Nobody can stop me! Yeah!

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:43.090
Cut it out!

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:45.160
Stop! Stop the car!

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.410
Yo, big guy!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.560
Whatcha looking at?!

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.090
Got a problem?!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.670
Hey, stop it!

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:54.670
I got news for you!

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:57.110
Imma cop! You'a flop!

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:58.380
Into the slammer you drop!

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.420
Yeah!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.780
Huh? What?

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.420
What was that?

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:07.680
Bad idea, Tetsu!

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:08.600
You don't want to mess with him!

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.340
He ain't nothing like the flimsy 
walls you've been running into to!

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:11.830
He's rotten to the core!

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:12.990
Listen up, yo!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.270
Imma cop! You'a flop!

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:16.400
Into the slammer you drop!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.690
No, I heard that part.

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:19.950
What did you say after that?

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:20.790
Yeah!

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.300
Huh? Yes?

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:23.560
I said yeah!

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:25.560
Uh, that was the least important part!

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.740
I can't hear a thing over this racket.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:28.650
No!

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.490
Fuck!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.590
Eh? Did you say fuck?!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:33.160
Did you just call me a fuck, bitch?!

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:34.260
Fucking jump!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.580
Fucking crazy monkey!

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.920
Don't call me a Fashion Leader!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.040
I know what you're trying 
to pull, frickin' Dankan!

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.420
Nobody has any idea what 
you're talking about!

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.130
Nobody said anything about fashion!

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:47.670
Hey! Stop messing around 
in the middle of the street!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:48.670
Shut up!

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.040
I'm gonna make fuckin' Curly here pay!

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.440
Don't make fun of my curls!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.390
Though I can understand 
why you're jealous.

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:57.610
I challenge you to a dissin' rap battle.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:01.270
I'll embarrass you so you can never 
show your face in this town again!

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:04.030
Hey, they're doing something over there!

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.570
Why are they dancing in 
the middle of the street?

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:10.300
Yo, yo. Tell me where your momma's from.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:13.870
Shimane? Akabane? 
Shirogane? Kingdom come?

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:17.460
Wait, have you seen my underwear, bum?

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.280
Why are you joining in?!

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:23.210
You're gonna punch him?!

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:24.090
Is that how this battle works?!

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:28.930
Yo, yo. You tell me 
where your momma's from?

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:31.560
Chris? Fifi? Mori? Kawai?

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.920
Who are you trying to diss?!

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.100
Is this a not-so-subtle jab 
at their horsey faces?!

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:39.180
Wait, your underwear was 
in the pool, Fakina!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:40.980
You had his underwear?!

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:42.660
Effin'!

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.770
What was that for?!

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:48.270
Why are you celebrating?!

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:49.610
Aren't you supposed to be friends?!

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:52.240
A total stranger has joined in!

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:54.910
I lose, bro.

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:57.750
To who? You're all losers in my mind.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:01.180
Will you do another collaboration 
with me one day?

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:03.090
Huh? What? What was that?

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:04.880
B–

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:06.690
Bro!

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:16.770
Suspect arrested at 3:40 PM

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.640
for interfering with an investigation.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:19.350
What?

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.210
You guys are...

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.870
Were we not needed?

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.300
Forgive me.

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:29.710
I didn't mean to trespass on 
the Shinsengumi's territory,

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:34.070
but I couldn't allow that 
villain to sully your name,

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:37.540
for I am a fan of the Shinsengumi.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:39.890
That uniform...

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:41.710
You guys are...

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:45.670
I am honored, as a 
fellow defender of Edo,

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:48.760
that the infamous vice 
chief recognizes us.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:54.140
I am the chief of the 
Mimawarigumi, Isaburo Sasaki.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.900
The Mimawarigumi...

00:11:55.900 --> 00:12:00.590
Our uniform was based off of yours.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:05.350
You can see that I am a rabid fan.

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:08.570
I've added my number to your 
address book under Sabu-chan.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:09.780
Feel free to message me when you want.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.780
My phone!

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:14.490
I'll add you as Toshi-chan.

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:15.670
B-Bastard!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.900
Oh, forgive me.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:21.230
I don't have many friends, so 
I lost myself for a moment.

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:23.090
Please don't get the wrong idea.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:26.920
Like I've been saying, I am 
a fan of the Shinsengumi.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:31.070
Your organization is 
a miracle in itself.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:35.400
Penniless beggars with no 
pedigree or training to speak of

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:40.930
banded together to keep 
Edo safe. A touching tale.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:45.310
I thought you might be able to

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:48.460
do something with the 
Sasaki family's failure,

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:52.760
but it appears that he didn't 
belong with you either.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.170
I believe that the Shinsengumi require

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:59.700
any member who breaks their 
code to commit seppuku.

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:02.720
You don't need to fear 
the Sasaki family.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:04.960
Feel free to cut him 
down whenever you want.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:10.660
We don't need this stain on 
the Sasaki family's honor.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.410
Worry not.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.880
I've already deleted the mistress's son

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:17.180
from my address book.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.720
Sorry.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:25.440
I deleted my address too.

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:28.730
Along with the address of 
my excellent pupil here.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:29.900
Toshi...

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:33.070
You see, I only have 
room in my address book

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:35.330
for Thorny boys.

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.660
Hey, have you heard?

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:52.420
The vice chief had a run-in 
with the Mimawarigumi.

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.940
I've been hearing a lot 
about them recently.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:58.650
Yeah, they're a new force,

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.600
but they've already accomplished more

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.240
than a lot of other 
police organizations.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:07.590
And I've heard that their chief, 
Isaburo Sasaki, is incredible.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.030
He's the heir to the Sasaki family.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.420
He can fight with two swords.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.990
And his skill with the pen is no less.

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.840
A master of three weapons.

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:17.200
They say the Bakufu 
relies heavily on him.

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:21.190
Speaking of which, the vice chief's 
new assistant is a Sasaki.

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:24.950
Yeah, they're half brothers.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:28.620
I heard that the vice 
chief was defending him.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:29.800
Seriously?

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.930
I figured the vice chief 
would have gutted him

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.380
already for his behavior.

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:34.560
Got that right.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.330
Excuse me, senpai!

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.310
If it wouldn't trouble you too much,

00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:58.740
could you allow me to use

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.360
the vending machine behind you?!

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:01.410
Huh?

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.620
My apologies.

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:07.870
I've been entrusted by the vice 
chief with an urgent mission.

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:10.430
Uh, I think he wanted Mayoston Lights.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:12.090
Huh? Did he want menthols?

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.310
No, wait. There's an urban myth

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:16.350
that menthols can cause impotence.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.290
I can't let the vice 
chief become impotent!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.110
No, wait!

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:22.070
Smoking is bad for the lungs,

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:24.610
and the smoke is harmful 
to other people,

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.560
especially infants, children, and the elderly.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.380
I can't let the vice chief become 
an impotent cancer-ridden murderer!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:32.650
Damn! What do I do?!

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:33.550
I know!

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:34.780
If I buy him one of those instead,

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.060
he won't become impotent! 
He'll become happy!

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.150
But wait! This is bad for kids!

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:41.660
Just buy my damn cigarettes!

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:44.220
And I didn't ask for 
Mayoston or menthols.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:45.810
I wanted Mayoboros, got it?

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:47.160
Yes, vice chief sir!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.130
Uh, Vice Chief?

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.580
Why are you standing around? 
I'll make you commit seppuku.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:54.130
Yeah, we can do that later,

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:56.200
but who is that?

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.300
Are you asleep?

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:58.950
I already introduced him.

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.980
He's my new assistant.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.840
Tetsunosuke Sasaki!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.890
Wait, I've never met this guy before!

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.020
I apologize.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:11.210
I was embarrassed by my baby 
face, so I wore sunglasses.

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:14.900
Wait, sunglasses have nothing 
to do with facial hair!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.430
After doing some thinking,

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:23.010
I've said goodbye to my 
old self and started anew!

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:24.870
I've given up on being a bad boy.

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:27.900
I'm moving forward from B to C.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:30.790
I have matured into a cherry boy!

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:33.190
Uh, you're going backwards?!

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:38.090
From now on, I will serve the vice chief

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:40.700
and help the Shinsengumi protect Edo!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.380
Hey, show your manners.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:46.520
Hey, his buddies went in the 
other direction, from B to A!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.910
They're Akiba boys now!

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:49.660
You're all regressing!

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:54.030
Wait, Tetsu. Why do you keep bowing?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.800
What? I'm trying to be sincere here.

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:59.200
Are you hard?

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:00.220
I'm not hard!

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.760
Are you hard?!

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:04.220
They sound so cherry! 
Those were the days!

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:06.370
Then stand up straight.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.150
You go first!

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:09.950
Stop trying to buy time.

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.580
Out of the way.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.330
Please wait, Vice Chief!

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:20.250
I'm not hard!

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:25.470
I see. Toshi did it again.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:31.410
Well, I could never tell if he was 
doing his job or just picking fights.

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.310
He's a real troublemaker.

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.410
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:35.420
Run!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:37.650
If you give up, the game's over!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:39.220
You don't understand.

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:42.900
If you and Toshi make 
an enemy of my brother,

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:47.910
he'll crush me and all 
of you in the process.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:50.310
You should have listened to him

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:53.660
and tossed my useless 
ass out on the street.

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:57.720
I'm sure you're all sick of me.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.670
You wish I would go away.

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:02.670
I know how you feel.

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:05.170
That's how I've always been treated,

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:07.680
ever since my mother died and

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:09.690
I was brought to the Sasaki home.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.680
I've gotten used to it.

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:16.190
You ever heard the name Thorny?

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:20.730
It's for nasty kids that prick 
you if you get too close.

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:25.590
That's what we called the 
bad boys where I come from.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.700
Including him.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.530
Thorny Toshi.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:36.460
He was bad enough to make 
you guys look like babies.

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:42.740
He spent every day fighting 
thugs from the local dojos.

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:51.430
A foolish boy who chose to live 
inside the thorny thicket.

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:55.150
That Thorny boy must be 
possessed by a devil.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:57.600
That's what they all used to say.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.980
But it wasn't like that.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:03.000
He was no different from you.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.370
That was the only place 
he had to belong.

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:10.360
Toshi was also the son of a mistress.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:16.500
His father was a rich 
farmer where we came from.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:22.150
Toshi was the secret son who 
didn't pop until his father died.

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:26.560
But the oldest son, 
Tamegoro, was a good man.

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.730
After Toshi lost his 
mother and his home,

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:32.390
Tamegoro took him in 
and looked after him.

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:37.010
Toshi was very fond of him.

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:40.300
But it didn't end well.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:44.900
When he was eleven, there was 
a large fire in the village.

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:46.900
Some brigands used this chance to break

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:48.650
into their home and attack Toshi,

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:54.660
but Tamegoro protected 
him and lost his eyes.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:57.880
The next thing he knew,

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:00.700
the brigands were strewn 
across the floor.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.830
His siblings stared at him with fear,

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:10.460
and the dried eyeballs on the 
floor stared at him in silence.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:16.860
That was when they started 
calling him Thorny.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:20.480
And he could no longer be 
with his beloved brother.

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:27.180
He defended you because 
he knows how you feel.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.430
Having to endure the 
hate of your family.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:31.810
Being indebted to your brother.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:34.200
Not having a place to belong.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:36.160
Being an outsider.

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:39.950
But Tetsu, even after he went astray,

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:43.880
after he threw himself 
into the thorny bramble,

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.920
he never stopped moving forward.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:49.100
Stronger! Become stronger!

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:51.160
Stronger than everyone else!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.860
He couldn't get over the fact that

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:56.100
he wasn't able to protect 
the people he loved.

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:57.230
Hey, hey, hey!

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:58.380
Hey, pass!

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.040
We're all the same, Tetsu.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:03.250
We're all outsiders and failures here.

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:05.190
Hey, pass!

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:07.850
But we never gave up on 
becoming respectable men

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:10.670
and eventually, we made it here.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.060
That's how men find a place to belong.

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:16.160
Stop hogging the ball!

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.660
You keep advancing,

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:20.240
cutting your way through 
the thorny brambles,

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:21.680
leaving a trail.

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:22.510
I'm here.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:25.220
Eventually, you're joined 
by others and the

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:27.210
trail becomes a wide path.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:33.930
I can't tell you what to do now 
that your family doesn't want you.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.590
You have to choose your own path.

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:39.520
But if you want a place to belong,

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:41.640
if you want respect,

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:43.930
you can never stop moving.

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:54.930
Never stop walking through the thorns.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:42.090
<b>The situation</b>

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:42.090
<b>suddenly gets worse!</b>

00:23:42.550 --> 00:23:44.930
<b>Thorny and Rosy</b>

00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:50.690
<b>Tetsunosuke has had a change of heart, but 
a gang of bad boys is looking for trouble...</b>

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:54.940
<b>Meanwhile, Gintoki has been taken by the 
Mimawarigumi, where Isaburo asks him to go on a mission.</b>
